; status: works — perpendicular from a corner onto a diagonal
paper square
mark --diag = through .a .c
mark perp --diag through .b

; `faces` is the evaluator's crease-pattern state, where unfolded marks
; don't subdivide (1 face); the emitted FOLD's 4-face crease pattern (marks
; graduate to F creases at emit) is covered by test_e2e_perp (kept)
; assert faces = 1
; assert steps = 1
; assert .a incident --diag
; assert .c incident --diag
; assert .b not incident --diag
